{
  "name": "FounderConsole \u2014 Activation Drip (new signups)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Activation drip\n\nFires when a new user signs up at founderconsole.ai. The FounderConsole backend should POST to this webhook with `{email, first_name, company_name, signup_source}`.\n\nFlow: upsert to Airtable \u2192 welcome email \u2192 wait 48h \u2192 check if they ran a simulation (Airtable `has_simulated` boolean) \u2192 nudge if not.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 560
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -200
      ],
      "id": "sticky-activation-1",
      "name": "Activation Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "founderconsole-signup",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        100
      ],
      "id": "act-webhook",
      "name": "Signup Webhook",
      "webhookId": "founderconsole-signup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "upsert",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "matchingColumns": [
            "email"
          ],
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "email": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
            "first_name": "={{ $json.body.first_name }}",
            "company_name": "={{ $json.body.company_name }}",
            "signup_source": "={{ $json.body.signup_source }}",
            "signed_up_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "has_simulated": false
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        100
      ],
      "id": "act-airtable-upsert",
      "name": "Airtable Upsert"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "welcome to FounderConsole \u2014 want me to walk you through it?",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "hey {{ $json.body.first_name }},\n\nthanks for signing up. FounderConsole is built so you can run your first survival simulation in under 5 minutes \u2014 just plug in your MRR, burn, and cash balance. it'll show you P50 / P90 survival probability and where the sensitivity is.\n\nstart here: https://founderconsole.ai/simulator\n\nthree things most founders miss on their first run:\n1. model hiring as a recurring expense, not one-time\n2. plug in realistic growth variance (not just an average)\n3. check the dilution tab after the sim \u2014 post-round cap table matters\n\nif you want, reply with your P50 and i'll tell you how it compares to other {{ $json.body.company_name }}-stage founders in our index.\n\n\u2014 Vishesh",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "id": "act-welcome-gmail",
      "name": "Welcome Email"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 48,
        "unit": "hours"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        100
      ],
      "id": "act-wait-48h",
      "name": "Wait 48h"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "filterByFormula": "={{ \"{email} = '\" + $('Signup Webhook').item.json.body.email + \"'\" }}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        500,
        100
      ],
      "id": "act-airtable-check",
      "name": "Check Activation"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "activation-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.fields.has_simulated }}",
              "rightValue": "true",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "notEqual"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        760,
        100
      ],
      "id": "act-if-simulated",
      "name": "Already Simulated?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Signup Webhook').item.json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "quick nudge on the simulator",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "hey {{ $('Signup Webhook').item.json.body.first_name }},\n\nnoticed you haven't run a simulation yet \u2014 no pressure, but the whole value is in seeing your actual P50.\n\nif you got stuck, the three inputs you need are:\n- current cash\n- monthly burn\n- MRR (or 0 if pre-revenue)\n\ntakes 90 seconds once you have those: https://founderconsole.ai/simulator\n\nor reply to this and i'll run one on a sample company close to yours so you can see the output first.\n\n\u2014 Vishesh",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        0
      ],
      "id": "act-nudge-gmail",
      "name": "Activation Nudge"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        200
      ],
      "id": "act-noop",
      "name": "Already Activated \u2014 done"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Signup Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Airtable Upsert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Airtable Upsert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Welcome Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Welcome Email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Wait 48h",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Wait 48h": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Activation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Activation": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Already Simulated?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Already Simulated?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Activation Nudge",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Already Activated \u2014 done",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false,
  "versionId": "",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}